e of the creature instantly dies. \(Recommended Amount: After 1d6 defeated sheets, define Essence Link\).)/DA(0 0 0 RG 0 0 0 rg /Helv 6 Tf)/DS(font: Helvetica,sans-serif 6.0pt; text-align:left; color:#000000 )/F 4/M(D:20240920184314-03'00')/NM(b99d61ce3a4f40cf882772ce7b0ba4f9)/Page 0/RC(<?xml version="1.0"?><body xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" xmlns:xfa="http://www.xfa.org/schema/xfa-data/1.0/" xfa:APIVersion="Acrobat:24.3.0" xfa:spec="2.0.2"  style="font-size:6.0pt;text-align:left;color:#000000;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal\;font-family:Helvetica,sans-serif;font-stretch:normal"><p dir="ltr"><span style="font-family:Helvetica">Part of a Whole - Constantly Active. Hides the Essence of an entity until it is defined through context by the GM*, being able to reuse it after defeat\ to start a new battle, but as a consequence, while the entity has its Essence hidden, if all Gear is destroyed, this instance of the creature instantly dies. \(Recommended Amount: After 1d6 defeated sheets, define Essence Link\).</span></p></body>)/Rect[34.7573 34.0139 251.214 83.2239]/Subj(Text Box)/Subtype/FreeText/T( )/Type/Annot>>endobj69 0 obj<</BS<</W 0>>/CA 1/Contents(Plant Bodies - Regurgitates a plant version of one of the consumed victims to help with combat through simple attacks. Victims until now: Domestic Animals, Horses, 450.000 Species of Arthropods, Neanderthal, Minotaur, Dinosaur,  Stone Golem, Human, Zektan\ians, 250 Diferent Mesopredators, Tigers, Lions, 45 Bird Species, Cyberbiological Automatons,  Bears, Mooses, European Dragons, Oriental Dragons, Mimics.)/DA(0 0 0 RG 0 0 0 rg /Helv 6 Tf)/DS(font: Helvetica,sans-serif 6.0pt; text-align:left; color:#000000 )/F 4/M(D:20240920184630-03'00')/NM(21be065b538a45e59a8a84bbd5301262)/Page 0/RC(<?xml version="1.0"?><body xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" xmlns:xfa="http://www.xfa.org/schema/xfa-data/1.0/" xfa:APIVersion="Acrobat:24.3.0" xfa:spec="2.0.2"  style="font-size:6.0pt;text-align:left;color:#000000;font